<p class=3D"MsoNormal">One year ago today you dismissed me from Honeyman St=
ate Park and gave me 24 hours to leave.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Today =97 on the anniversary =97 police arrived at a=
 locked federal gate on federal land where I serve as a U.S. Forest Service=
 caretaker. Three officers. No agency identified. They told me they were co=
ncerned about what I was posting online.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">I recorded them leaving.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">I told them I wouldn't speak without an attorney.<o:=
p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">I told the officer who called me afterward that this=
 was intimidation and retaliation on the anniversary of the day you dismiss=
ed me.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">He agreed it could have been handled differently.<o:=
p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">It is now Evidence Page 10.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><a href=3D"https://oprdvolunteerabuse.org/evidence/p=
olice-intimidation">oprdvolunteerabuse.org/evidence/police-intimidation</a>=
<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">This is what your institution produced by involving =
law enforcement in a First Amendment retaliation case on the anniversary of=
 the dismissal.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">A new evidence page.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">A YouTube short with 800 witnesses and counting.<o:p=
></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">And a stronger case.<o:p></o:p></p>
